/E (We chose 15 August deliberately. On this date seventy-nine years ago, India became an independent nation. It was the culmination of a struggle that drew on the deepest reserves of courage and imagination that a people can possess. Today, as India enters its eightieth year of independence, the relationship between India and the world is being remade, and Cambridge has a part to play in that remaking.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
