/E (CLIFF was launched on 26 June 2026 at Lucy Cavendish College. It exists to deepen the engagement between Cambridge and India through student opportunity, research, partnerships, and public dialogue. It is young. Its best ideas are ahead of it. But the energy in the room on 26 June told us something: that there is an appetite for this idea, and that people are ready to build.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [14]
>>
