>>
endobj
141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (Beyond the government headlines, the best example for me, of the economic, people, ideas and cultural partnership between the countries is in Leicester Square: where you can find a bronze Dilwale Dulhaniya Le Jayenge statue, right next to Haldirams' first foreign outlet, and two hotels owned by an Indian entrepreneur who has been a leading job creator for Britain. 20 years ago, the partnership was aspirational but unrealised. The success of initiatives like CLIFF is important for the bilateral relationship to continue growing.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
