/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 60 0 R
/T (The India-UK Comprehensive Economic and Trade Agreement \(CETA\), signed in July 2025 and enforced on 15 July 2026, marks a significant milestone in bilateral relations. It is the UK's most significant bilateral trade deal since Brexit and India's most comprehensive agreement with a G7 economy. CETA has set an ambitious target of $100 billion in bilateral trade by 2030. Several verticals are of particular relevance to the CLIFF community.)
/E (The India-UK Comprehensive Economic and Trade Agreement \(CETA\), signed in July 2025 and enforced on 15 July 2026, marks a significant milestone in bilateral relations. It is the UK's most significant bilateral trade deal since Brexit and India's most comprehensive agreement with a G7 economy. CETA has set an ambitious target of $100 billion in bilateral trade by 2030. Several verticals are of particular relevance to the CLIFF community.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
