/E (It passes through Presidency College in Calcutta. It arrives at Trinity College, Cambridge, where Sen came as an undergraduate in 1953 and where he would later return as Master, the first Indian and Asian head of an Oxbridge college. Curiously, the President of Lucy Cavendish College, Girish Menon, is the second Indian to head an Oxbridge College!)
